      "content": "i was reading some stuff about the heat death of the universe and just... it feels so pointless. like, we are just these accidental collections of atoms that evolved to feel pain and anxiety just so we could pass on genes that don't even matter in the long run. it feels like consciousness is just a biological mistake. a glitch that makes us suffer for no reason.",
